{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）女兒陳康堤與網壇「一哥」黃澤林拍拖半年便分手，近日黃澤林更被指無縫接軌撻着女神譚旻萱（Mandy），令一手為女兒牽紅線的Eason內疚不已，與老婆徐濠縈齊齊取消關注黃澤林，而今日（4日）康緹出席公開活動，雖然沒有受訪</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:25:52.635134+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:44:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.236177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.236177+00:00","content_hash":"b0b38648e0f4819d63e930aca37baff7024e232a6d25be661493be6835bba6c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}